'''Osamu Mikumo & Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Osamu Mikumo & Doge
|image = E 617.png
|appearance = [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high HP, low damage, speed and range and a 100% chance to create a Lv.3 [[Wave Attack]], as well as Omni Strike with 50 piercing range and immunity to a large number of effects.

==Strategy==
If Osamu Mikumo & Doge's waves are too hard to deal with, use [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to stop them from destroying your meatshields. Otherwise, take note of their incredibly low DPS and range: even without a Wave Shield their damage is abysmal, so tanky cats such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can completely stop them in their tracks, especially on lower difficulties.

